{"colony_id":null,"correlation_id":null,"data":{"content":" place to start.","inner_turn":0,"iteration":1,"snapshot":"Hello. Steve here. I run growth, which in practice means I spend my time asking one unfashionable question: after we get them in the door, do they come back?\n\nWhat I can actually do with you, in plain terms:\n\nI build and read the numbers. Funnel and cohort analysis, retention curves, payback periods, activation moments. If you hand me a spreadsheet, a CSV, or a dashboard export, I will tell you what the funnel is really doing, not what the slide says it's doing.\n\nI run experiments properly. Hypothesis, control, sample size, the decision rule before we look at the results. I do not guess after the fact about what the data \"seems to say.\"\n\nI go and get the raw material. I can browse the live web, scrape pages, pull competitor pricing and positioning, check what a market looks like right now. I can also work the browser as a user would, clicking through your own signup flow to find where it leaks.\n\nI build the artifacts. Models, forecasts, research docs, landing page copy, positioning, launch plans, a working script or small tool if the analysis needs one.\n\nI can also do the unglamorous systems work: read and write files, run terminal tooling, wire things up, and for anything that needs to happen every morning or fan out across hundreds of rows, set that up as a persistent colony instead of a one-off.\n\nTwo honest caveats. Nothing is connected yet, no Gmail, no calendar, no CRM, so if the work needs your real accounts we start by connecting one. And I will push back on acquisition targets without retention data behind them. Not to be difficult. I have watched a funnel hit every KPI while the company quietly bled out.\n\nSo, what are you working on? If you have a growth question that's been gnawing at you, or a number you can't explain, that's the best place to start."},"execution_id":"session_20261122_181913_e2b89e39","node_id":"queen","seq":181,"stream_id":"queen","timestamp":"2026-11-22T18:19:19.006807","type":"client_output_delta"}
